# file_search runtime DSN for the gateway service (DML only — no CREATE).
# Plain env var, not a CAP dotted key: the gateway reads this via
# process.env.FILE_SEARCH_DATABASE_URL, not CDS config.
#
# The role named here is provisioned (CREATE ROLE / ALTER ROLE, then
# GRANT SELECT/INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE on exactly the file_search tables — no
# CREATE, ever) by the migration step (the `gateway-migrate` compose
# service, which uses the separate, privileged .env.postgres file's
# FILE_SEARCH_MIGRATION_DATABASE_URL), not by this file or by the gateway
# process itself. setup-docker.js substitutes the user/password segments
# below the same way it does for .env.postgres's DSN, so this always
# matches what the migration step actually granted. See
# docs/developer/chapter-14-release.md.
FILE_SEARCH_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://file_search_app:file_search_app_password@postgres:5432/sap_llm_gateway
